      "source_quote": "史臣曰：若夫義重於生，前典垂誥，斯蓋先哲之所貴也。",
      "reading": "以重義於生為前典之訓，史臣未具名。",
      "note": "以重義於生為前典之訓，史臣未具名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 25,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:received_sentence1-25",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ant_dk4_dds_B",
      "source_quote": "故孟子稱生者我所欲，義亦我所欲，二事必不可兼得，寧捨生而取義。",
      "reading": "此句明言據孟子，屬義旨改述。",
      "note": "此句明言據孟子，屬義旨改述。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-043-collective-commentary:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 25,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
